# A Feather in One's Cap (windurst 1): the other operands. Fame level 3 (125), All At Sea's Prog var 1 (Hat in Hand's 48
# not offered). Hat in Hand accepted without the New Model Hat (GM): no Hat in Hand arm, and the offer wants Hat in Hand
# completed: his random standard event. Hat in Hand completed (GM). Available, 3 feathers, the repeat var 0: nothing
# (neither accepted nor the var). The var 1 by GM while available: the trade plays 79, and its finish (available) takes
# the else: fame 16, the var 0, 1500 gil, the trade confirmed, needToZone. After a rezone: 75; set accepted inside the
# event (a GM), option 1: neither arm (nothing). Completed (GM) with Hat in Hand available (GM) and no needToZone: Hat in
# Hand's 48 not offered (Prog 1), the third arm's 75 (the repeat) does not read Hat in Hand. Then the New Model Hat (GM)
# with this quest completed (no needToZone), and accepted (GM: available first, since addQuest keeps a completed bit):
# Hat in Hand's 52 before this quest's 75 / 78 (his script's one if-chain: Hat in Hand's arms first). Accepted, 3
# feathers and a pebble: 79 (npcUtil.tradeHas is not exact), its finish: completed, 1500 gil, the feathers taken.
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-65.0,-2.9,-145.7 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Windurst 125
quest Windurst.HatInHand accepted
charvar Quest[2][23]Prog 1
item GiantBirdFeather x6
item Pebble
login
trigger Baren-Moren                     # Hat in Hand accepted, no hat; this quest available: a random standard event
finish
quest Windurst.HatInHand completed
trade Baren-Moren GiantBirdFeather x3   # available, the var 0: nothing
charvar QuestFeatherInOnesCap_var 1
trade Baren-Moren GiantBirdFeather x3   # the var 1: 79 (1500)
finish                                  # available: the else: fame 16; the var 0; 1500 gil; the feathers taken; needToZone
rezone
trigger Baren-Moren                     # Hat in Hand completed, available, level 3: 75
quest Windurst.AFeatherInOnesCap accepted
finish option=1                         # finished while accepted: no arm; nothing
quest Windurst.AFeatherInOnesCap completed
quest Windurst.HatInHand available
trigger Baren-Moren                     # Hat in Hand available, All At Sea's Prog 1: no 48; completed: 75 (the repeat)
finish option=0
keyitem NewModelHat
trigger Baren-Moren                     # the hat, count 0, this quest completed: 52 (Hat in Hand's arm first), not 75
finish option=0
quest Windurst.AFeatherInOnesCap available
quest Windurst.AFeatherInOnesCap accepted
trigger Baren-Moren                     # the hat, this quest accepted: 52, not 78
finish option=0
trade Baren-Moren GiantBirdFeather x3 Pebble x1   # accepted, 3 feathers and a pebble: 79 (1500)
finish                                  # completed (fame 16); 1500 gil; the feathers taken (tradeHas confirms them), the pebble kept; needToZone
